{"3785520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragomir: The Dreaming", "steam_appid": 3785520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragomir: The Dreaming</i></strong><br><br><i>In the beginning, there was only the Breath… and from it, all realms were born.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before stars lit the sky, the <strong>Great Winged Mother</strong> and <strong>Orrann</strong>, the force of light, shaped <strong>Dragomir</strong> from the void. A land where elements thrived, life stirred, and shadow waited. Out of a long-forgotten conflict, the <strong>Dytann</strong>—elemental wolves—were created to defend the fragile Dream. You are <strong>Rehocca</strong>, one such wolf, called to uncover ancient truths and confront a growing darkness. Your greatest challenge exploring Dragomir is finding four lost wolf pups and returning them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>old-school high fantasy adventure</strong>, the world is vast, beautiful, and alive with mystery. Many creatures to encounter are friendly and can be deadly foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> sprawling environments—from towering ruins and verdant glades to elemental caverns.<br><strong>Quest</strong>—meet ancient beings, aid struggling villages, and face corrupted foes. <br><strong>Craft</strong> your survival—gather ingredients, prepare nourishing food, and create enchanted items.<br><br>Engage in <strong>combat</strong>, both <strong>melee</strong> and <strong>magical</strong>. <br>Solve <strong>puzzles</strong> and uncover secret pathways where only the nimblest wolves may tread. <br><strong>Collect</strong> lore fragments, rare artifacts, and in-game <strong>achievements</strong> that deepen your connection to the world’s history.<br><br><strong>Level up</strong> Rehocca’s powers—unlock spells and crafting. <br><strong>Save your progress</strong> anytime, allowing for <strong>family-friendly</strong> play—perfect for casual exploration or deep, lore-driven sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step uncovers lost memories, reshapes your path, and weaves you deeper into the Dreaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragomir: The Dreaming</strong> invites you to an experience of discovery, challenge, and wonder. As the first chapter of a greater saga, it offers both adventure and a beginning…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the breath stirs again.<br><br>Will you answer the call?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragomir: The Dreaming</i></strong><br><br><i>In the beginning, there was only the Breath… and from it, all realms were born.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before stars lit the sky, the <strong>Great Winged Mother</strong> and <strong>Orrann</strong>, the force of light, shaped <strong>Dragomir</strong> from the void. A land where elements thrived, life stirred, and shadow waited. Out of a long-forgotten conflict, the <strong>Dytann</strong>—elemental wolves—were created to defend the fragile Dream. You are <strong>Rehocca</strong>, one such wolf, called to uncover ancient truths and confront a growing darkness. Your greatest challenge exploring Dragomir is finding four lost wolf pups and returning them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>old-school high fantasy adventure</strong>, the world is vast, beautiful, and alive with mystery. Many creatures to encounter are friendly and can be deadly foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> sprawling environments—from towering ruins and verdant glades to elemental caverns.<br><strong>Quest</strong>—meet ancient beings, aid struggling villages, and face corrupted foes. <br><strong>Craft</strong> your survival—gather ingredients, prepare nourishing food, and create enchanted items.<br><br>Engage in <strong>combat</strong>, both <strong>melee</strong> and <strong>magical</strong>. <br>Solve <strong>puzzles</strong> and uncover secret pathways where only the nimblest wolves may tread. <br><strong>Collect</strong> lore fragments, rare artifacts, and in-game <strong>achievements</strong> that deepen your connection to the world’s history.<br><br><strong>Level up</strong> Rehocca’s powers—unlock spells and crafting. <br><strong>Save your progress</strong> anytime, allowing for <strong>family-friendly</strong> play—perfect for casual exploration or deep, lore-driven sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step uncovers lost memories, reshapes your path, and weaves you deeper into the Dreaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragomir: The Dreaming</strong> invites you to an experience of discovery, challenge, and wonder. As the first chapter of a greater saga, it offers both adventure and a beginning…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the breath stirs again.<br><br>Will you answer the call?</p>", "short_description": "Dragomir: The Dreaming — Play as Réhocca, an elemental Dytann wolf, in a high fantasy world shaped by ancient myth. Guided by The Dreaming, explore sacred lands, uncover lost truths, and face the rising darkness of the Moldering. The first breath of a greater epic begins.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785520/c59c6aade201f92406b910d8b71d650a0bd2a7ca/header.jpg?t=1782755889", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785520/bce26ada779f82d8ffb2d0e7b0fc40cf9fca15d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782755889", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785520/bce26ada779f82d8ffb2d0e7b0fc40cf9fca15d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782755889", "website": "https://www.fourpawsgs.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><str